{"event": "token", "client_ms": 25857, "data": {"request_id": "1231a1fdc918", "seq": 50, "ts": "2026-10-27T17:39:17.293Z", "t_ms": 25806, "delta": " evaluate five specific tools, requiring only that their inputs and outputs be text strings and that a few demonstrations can be provided [C"}}
{"event": "token", "client_ms": 26045, "data": {"request_id": "1231a1fdc918", "seq": 51, "ts": "2026-10-27T17:39:17.479Z", "t_ms": 25992, "delta": "8]:\n* **Question Answering:** Based on Atlas, a retrieval-augmented model finetuned on Natural Questions ["}}
{"event": "token", "client_ms": 26237, "data": {"request_id": "1231a1fdc918", "seq": 52, "ts": "2026-10-27T17:39:17.669Z", "t_ms": 26181, "delta": "C8].\n* **Calculator:** Performs simple calculations limited to four basic arithmetic operations, with results rounded to two decimal places"}}
{"event": "token", "client_ms": 26376, "data": {"request_id": "1231a1fdc918", "seq": 53, "ts": "2026-10-27T17:39:17.811Z", "t_ms": 26324, "delta": " [C8].\n* **Wikipedia Search:** Uses a BM25 retriever over the KILT Wikipedia dump to retrieve short text snippets ["}}
{"event": "token", "client_ms": 26656, "data": {"request_id": "1231a1fdc918", "seq": 54, "ts": "2026-10-27T17:39:18.078Z", "t_ms": 26591, "delta": "C8].\n* **Machine Translation:** Uses the 600M-parameter NLLB model to translate from 200 languages"}}
