{"event": "token", "client_ms": 27147, "data": {"request_id": "1231a1fdc918", "seq": 56, "ts": "2026-10-27T17:39:18.581Z", "t_ms": 27094, "delta": " date to provide temporal awareness [C8][C9].\n\n### §4: Experiments\nToolformer is built upon a 6.7"}}
